  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Slovak - Kenyan cooperation for modern schools</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Slovensko &#x2013; kensk&#xe1; spolupr&#xe1;ca pre modern&#xe9; &#x161;koly</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In this already third project we are working with a partner organization Kasigau Wildlife Trust to equip 5 schools with PCs, train 50 teachers and 1,200 pupils.In 10 pilot school a training was established where students can themselves manage a &quot;training firm&quot; and gain experience in a business environment.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">V s&#xfa;&#x10d;asnom v porad&#xed; u&#x17e; tre&#x165;om projekte pracujeme s partnerskou organiz&#xe1;ciou Kasigau Wildlife Trust na vybaven&#xed; po&#x10d;&#xed;ta&#x10d;mi a technikou &#x10f;al&#x161;&#xed;ch 5 &#x161;k&#xf4;l, vy&#x161;kolen&#xed; 50 u&#x10d;ite&#x13e;ov a zapojen&#xed; &#x10f;al&#x161;&#xed;ch 1200 &#x17e;iakov. Na 10 pilotn&#xfd;ch &#x161;kol&#xe1;ch vznikaj&#xfa; cvi&#x10d;n&#xe9; firmy, ktor&#xe9; si &#x161;tudenti sami bud&#xfa; riadi&#x165; a z&#xed;skaj&#xfa; tak sk&#xfa;senosti z podnikate&#x13e;sk&#xe9;ho prostredia, ktor&#xe9; bud&#xfa; nesk&#xf4;r m&#xf4;c&#x165; vyu&#x17e;i&#x165; v praxi.</narrative>
  </description>
